        "Grease the Dutch oven thoroughly with oil or cooking spray, paying special attention to the bottom and lower sides where the kugel will form its prized crust. Press the noodle mixture firmly and evenly into the pot, compacting it with the back of a spoon or your hands. The mixture should be densely packed, which creates the contrast between the dark, crunchy exterior and the soft, custardy interior.",
