        "To serve, spread the labneh in a shallow bowl or on a flat plate using the back of a large spoon. Create a generous swirling, swooshed pattern by pressing the spoon down and sweeping it in a circular motion, forming a well or channel in the center. This traditional presentation is not just decorative: the channels and wells create pools that catch and hold the olive oil.",
