        "Continue cooking the combined mixture over medium-low heat for 10 more minutes, stirring frequently as the thickened mixture is now prone to sticking and scorching. This additional cooking time allows the flavors of the roasted eggplant and the spiced tomato to meld into a unified, harmonious whole rather than tasting like two separate components mixed together. The dip should be thick enough that it holds its shape on a spoon without running or dripping.",
